  "description": "Audit logging for Entity Framework Core using SaveChangesInterceptor. Tracks insert, update, and delete operations with old/new value snapshots, user context, configurable opt-in or opt-out auditing, per-operation ignore rules, and day-by-day archiving of old audit rows to gzip JSONL.",
