  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: AuditOperation flags and AuditOptions.IgnoreOperations (skip only inserts, updates or deletes of an entity type; IgnoreEntities = all operations). AuditArchiver: find the oldest day before a cutoff, export a day as gzip JSONL with a SHA256 manifest, verify an archive, delete exactly the archived id range of that day in batches, and ArchiveNextDayAsync that ties it together over a pluggable IAuditArchiveStore.",
